   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Welcome, Maths Detective!"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "This is a **check-in**, not a test.\n\nWe want to find out what you already know, so your next lessons fit you perfectly.\n\nKeep paper and a pencil nearby for working out."
  },
