   "caption": "Detective mode on! We are looking for clues about what you know."
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Stop 1: Place value and rounding"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "Each digit has a value that depends on its **place value**.\n\nIn 4,825 the 4 is worth 4,000, the 8 is worth 800, the 2 is worth 20 and the 5 is worth 5."
  },
  {
   "type": "chart",
   "kind": "table",
   "title": "Place value of 4,825",
