   "text": "Stop 4: Fractions"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "A **fraction** is part of a whole. In 3/4 the bottom number says how many equal parts there are.\n\nFractions like 1/2 and 2/4 are **equivalent**: they are the same amount."
  },
  {
   "type": "chart",
   "kind": "fraction",
